{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"(This chisel was wielded by master masons on the crafting of the World's Cornetstone. It is an Artifact. This can be used like banner of Krig rune to etch certain marks in the ground to give certain advantages in large fights. \nAdditionally the bearers of the Chisel can use it to set their intentions in stone to give them advantage on any skill check for one day. Useable once every 24 hours. \nThe Bearer gains 1 major beneficial property and 1 minor, based on random rolls once every 24 hours.\nIt can be used to sculpt petrified flesh. Only attunable by masons.)","created_at":"2020-08-09T07:20:43.324000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-09T07:21:47.188000Z","id":"741918872222826496","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
