{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"(Tonight leaf will dream of the Sasquatch Bigfoot who came with Hiram and Pym to the new world. Of the strength of his arms as he built the first colony. Of the way he cared for Hiram as he would his own child. She will know that she too will be great. And that her destiny as a mason can be etched by her actions. And she will learn of the tinkers of Arcania. Of Kairo and Hailey. Of Iona and Otis. Of Anhk and Clovis. Though they be just fleeting images of faces and names past. She will know that they are still working. Still tinkering with fate to keep us on the path.)","created_at":"2020-08-09T08:27:15.557000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741935616861929513","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
