{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf opens her eyes and smiles, thinking about the dream she had. Those unfamiliar faces, and yet a feeling of familiarity. How Daysong so easily trusted her with something so powerful. Her smile falters. She's worried that she won't be able to live up to people's expectations... Her eyes refocus on Rockman, and her smile returns. She knows that even if she did do something wrong, Rock would still believe in her, still be there to keep her safe.","created_at":"2020-08-09T17:49:42.697000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742077162625957898","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
