{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"She begins to play, unsure of herself. She thinks her jagged yellow teath and goblin claws will ruin it somehow. She runs through a quick scale, and one of the notes resonates with her. Something about it feels right. She continues playing, letting the music guide her. It's a light, cheerful tune, mostly of high notes. She imbues the song with the happiness she feels from others, and the love and joy she hopes to give in turn.","created_at":"2020-08-09T18:59:49.502000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742094807245258876","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
